  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2015-07-18.mk21.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 144 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Members of the Louisville Orchestra joined the band for two songs, according to the uploader's numbered notes [1]\n- Conor Oberst sang on one of the orchestra-backed songs [1]\n- Johnny Quaid played guitar with the band on one song [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2015-07-18.mk21.flac16**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk21 (FOB/ORTF wide) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/48) [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @courierjournal: [Gallery | My Morning Jacket at Forecastle 2015](https://www.courier-journal.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/arts/music/2015/07/18/gallery--my-morning-jacket-at-forecastle-2015/30372379/) [3]",
